  "term": "PPVT",
  "definition": "PPVT stands for the posterior paraventricular nucleus of the thalamus, a brain region described here as important in stress regulation. In this source, signaling in the pPVT is linked to stress-triggered return of alcohol-seeking after dependence and abstinence.",
